{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝ごはん大好き( ﹡ˆoˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諸事情により、さつまいもを\n大量に入手したので、\n毎日頑張って消費してます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は、さつまいものお味噌汁を\n作りました  ♭♭\n美味しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、何でこんなにさつまいもを\n沢山頂いたのかというと...\nその謎は、明日、11月14日発売の\n『EX大衆』さんでわかります！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてEX大衆さんでソログラビアを\nやらせて頂きました！\nすごく嬉しかったし、楽しかったです(,,^_^,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謎が解けない方は、ぜひぜひ、\n見てみてねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみにー\\(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、埼玉県の地元の近くの\n冬桜をお母さんと見に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中で、真っ黒なイノシシに遭遇して\n熊かと思ってお母さんと2人で\nヒヤッとしました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅葉と桜、桜とイルミネーション、\n秋と春と冬がいっぺんに来たみたいな、\nそれぞれのコラボが\nとっても幻想的でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これはお母さんです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りに、近くの温泉にも\n入ってきました ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉には良い所が沢山あるので、\nぜひ遊びにきてほしいなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、そんなことを思ってたら、\nナイスタイミングで、\nBUBKAさんで埼玉出身メンバーの\n取材をして頂きました(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、かなりん、伊織と、\n沢山地元トークができて\nすごく楽しかったです\\(  ˆoˆ  )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉県民の皆さんも、\n埼玉をまだまだ知らないよーって\n皆さんも、誰が読んでも\nきっと笑っちゃう楽しい内容になってるので、\nこれを読んで皆さんが笑顔に\nなってくれたらいいなっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11月30日発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします♭♭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼でーん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の『乃木坂工事中』は、\nまりか、ひめたん、私の3人での\n温泉ロケ回です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかこのメンバーで\nロケに行かせて頂けるなんて...\n本当に嬉しかったです＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、プレゼンしてくれて\n有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"企画してくださった番組さん、\n有難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝です_(__)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ、見てくださーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ブランコで無邪気になるハタチ。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/11/13/1975295/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}